{"id": "34667", "title": "列女传", "author": "刘向", "category": "文学名著", "count": 7, "available": 7, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34667/34667s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34667.htm", "intro": "西汉刘向传。7篇7卷。分母仪、明贤、仁智、贞顺、节义、辩通、劈孽等七门，共计105名妇女事迹。此书屡经传写，进本书如陈婴母等东汉以来凡16事均为后人所增。", "base": "files/article/html/34/34667", "chapters": [{"title": "卷之一　母仪传", "file": "2215943.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷之二　贤明传", "file": "2215944.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷之三　仁智传", "file": "2215945.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷之四　贞顺传", "file": "2215946.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷之五　节义传", "file": "2215947.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷之六　辩通传", "file": "2215948.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷之七　孽嬖传", "file": "2215949.html", "available": true}]}